WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:23.532
Photo Finish by Polly Sweetnam.

00:00:23.592 --> 00:00:27.574
Lisa works at Black and Sons.

00:00:27.635 --> 00:00:31.716
Black and Sons is a large company.

00:00:31.776 --> 00:00:35.618
Lisa works in the Accounts Department.

00:00:35.678 --> 00:00:42.686
The work is very important. But it is not very exciting.

00:00:42.746 --> 00:00:46.762
Your holiday is next week, Lisa.

00:00:46.822 --> 00:00:48.293
Are you excited?

00:00:48.352 --> 00:00:52.344
Oh, yes! I'm going to go with Alice.
 
00:00:52.404 --> 00:00:54.966
We're going to go to Greece.

00:00:55.026 --> 00:00:57.216
It will be fun.

00:00:57.276 --> 00:01:01.478
Perhaps something exciting will happen.

00:01:01.538 --> 00:01:05.060
Alice is Lisa's friend.

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:08.541
Alice works for Black and Sons too.

00:01:08.601 --> 00:01:12.178
She works in the Marketing Department.

00:01:12.238 --> 00:01:14.976
Alice is an artist.

00:01:15.036 --> 00:01:19.648
She designs advertisements for Black and Sons.

00:01:19.708 --> 00:01:23.640
I want to work with Alice.

00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:27.902
I want to work in the Marketing Department.

00:01:27.962 --> 00:01:32.764
The Marketing Department is always busy.

00:01:32.824 --> 00:01:36.376
Everybody is very friendly.

00:01:36.436 --> 00:01:41.540
They have exciting jobs.

00:01:41.600 --> 00:01:45.913
Alice phones Lisa.

00:01:45.973 --> 00:01:49.274
They are going to get their passports today.

00:01:49.334 --> 00:01:52.176
They must go to the Post Office.

00:01:52.236 --> 00:01:53.917
Hi, Lisa.

00:01:53.977 --> 00:01:55.318
Hello, Alice.

00:01:55.378 --> 00:01:57.588
Let's meet at lunch time.

00:01:57.648 --> 00:02:00.930
Then we can get our passports for our holiday.

00:02:00.990 --> 00:02:02.131
OK.

00:02:02.191 --> 00:02:09.394
I'll meet you outside the office at 12.30.

00:02:09.453 --> 00:02:16.246
Lisa and Alice are in the Post Office.

00:02:16.306 --> 00:02:20.949
The assistant gives the passport forms to the two friends.

00:02:21.008 --> 00:02:23.650
Please fill in these forms.

00:02:23.710 --> 00:02:26.231
Where are your passport photos?

00:02:26.291 --> 00:02:31.104
Here are my photos. Oh, no!
 
00:02:31.164 --> 00:02:35.166
My photos aren't in my bag!

00:02:35.226 --> 00:02:39.827
My photos are at home!

00:02:39.887 --> 00:02:46.642
Lisa, you must go to the photo booth in the old bus station.

00:02:46.702 --> 00:02:49.500
You can get your photos there.

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:54.800
Oh, no! I hate the old bus station.
 
00:02:54.900 --> 00:02:57.781
I don't want to go there.

00:02:57.840 --> 00:03:01.404
But you must get the photos today.

00:03:01.464 --> 00:03:02.645
Listen.

00:03:02.705 --> 00:03:04.796
I can fill in the forms.

00:03:04.856 --> 00:03:07.479
Go to the bus station, Lisa.

00:03:07.539 --> 00:03:09.923
Go and get your photos.

00:03:09.983 --> 00:03:14.238
I'll wait for you here.

00:03:14.297 --> 00:03:19.700
Nobody goes to the bus station now.

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:23.852
There is a new bus station in the centre of town.

00:03:23.912 --> 00:03:28.736
The old bus station is empty and dark.

00:03:28.796 --> 00:03:31.867
Lisa walks quickly.

00:03:31.927 --> 00:03:35.960
Her shoes make a loud noise on the ground.

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:39.764
Then she sees the photo booth.

00:03:39.824 --> 00:03:43.528
There is nobody in the photo booth.

00:03:43.588 --> 00:03:45.901
Lisa is happy.

00:03:45.960 --> 00:03:50.334
She can get her photos quickly.

00:03:50.394 --> 00:03:54.616
Lisa goes into the photo booth.

00:03:54.676 --> 00:03:57.888
She puts her money into the machine.

00:03:57.948 --> 00:04:00.580
She closes the little curtain.

00:04:00.640 --> 00:04:02.782
She sits down.

00:04:02.842 --> 00:04:05.173
She waits.

00:04:05.233 --> 00:04:07.294
Flash!

00:04:07.354 --> 00:04:10.123
The camera is very quick.

00:04:10.183 --> 00:04:14.961
Flash! Flash! Flash!
 
00:04:15.021 --> 00:04:19.672
Now Lisa can get her passport today.

00:04:19.732 --> 00:04:23.793
Lisa goes outside the photo booth.

00:04:23.853 --> 00:04:28.744
Her photos will come out of a slot in the machine.

00:04:28.804 --> 00:04:31.884
Lisa hears a noise.

00:04:31.944 --> 00:04:35.155
Some photos are coming out of the slot.

00:04:35.215 --> 00:04:37.746
Are they her photos?

00:04:37.806 --> 00:04:40.762
No, it is too soon.

00:04:40.821 --> 00:04:44.108
Lisa's photos can't be ready.

00:04:44.168 --> 00:04:46.941
But who is in the photos?

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:49.892
There is nobody in the bus station.

00:04:49.952 --> 00:04:53.394
Nobody else is waiting for photos.

00:04:53.454 --> 00:04:57.116
Lisa is alone.

00:04:57.176 --> 00:05:01.658
Lisa takes the photos out of the slot.

00:05:01.718 --> 00:05:05.130
There is a man in the pictures.

00:05:05.190 --> 00:05:08.502
But something is wrong.

00:05:08.562 --> 00:05:11.465
She is frightened.

00:05:11.525 --> 00:05:15.618
The four photos show a murder!

00:05:15.678 --> 00:05:18.910
There is a man in the first photo.

00:05:18.970 --> 00:05:21.342
He is very large.

00:05:21.402 --> 00:05:26.074
He is wearing a black coat and a red scarf.

00:05:26.134 --> 00:05:29.806
The man is sitting in the photo booth.

00:05:29.866 --> 00:05:32.228
He is smiling.

00:05:32.288 --> 00:05:35.180
It is not a nice smile.

00:05:35.240 --> 00:05:38.702
It is a cruel smile.

00:05:38.762 --> 00:05:42.298
The man is in the second photo.

00:05:42.358 --> 00:05:45.622
The man is looking to the right.

00:05:45.682 --> 00:05:48.804
He is afraid.

00:05:48.864 --> 00:05:53.074
Something is happening in the third photo.

00:05:53.134 --> 00:05:57.195
Somebody is holding the man's scarf.

00:05:57.255 --> 00:06:02.636
Somebody is holding the man's scarf very tightly.

00:06:02.696 --> 00:06:07.758
The large man is pulling at his scarf.

00:06:07.818 --> 00:06:11.810
There is no man in the fourth photo.

00:06:11.870 --> 00:06:14.444
There are two hands.

00:06:14.504 --> 00:06:18.767
The hands are holding the red scarf.

00:06:18.827 --> 00:06:22.510
There is a ring on one of the hands.

00:06:22.570 --> 00:06:25.602
It is a strange ring.

00:06:25.662 --> 00:06:29.084
There is a snake on the ring.

00:06:29.144 --> 00:06:32.917
There is a tattoo on the other hand.

00:06:32.976 --> 00:06:36.800
It is a tattoo of a bird.

00:06:36.859 --> 00:06:41.658
The hands are the murderer's hands.

00:06:41.718 --> 00:06:46.217
Now Lisa is very frightened.

00:06:46.277 --> 00:06:50.870
The man with the red scarf is dead.

00:06:50.929 --> 00:06:53.732
But where is his body?

00:06:53.792 --> 00:06:56.853
Where is the murderer?

00:06:56.913 --> 00:07:01.086
Is the murderer in the bus station?

00:07:01.145 --> 00:07:05.158
The photos show the murder.

00:07:05.218 --> 00:07:09.977
The murderer knows about the photos.

00:07:10.037 --> 00:07:15.375
The murderer will come back to the photo booth.

00:07:15.435 --> 00:07:18.966
He will want the photos.

00:07:19.026 --> 00:07:24.497
I'm in danger!

00:07:24.557 --> 00:07:31.039
Lisa and Alice are at the police station.

00:07:31.099 --> 00:07:34.740
They are telling their story to the police.

00:07:34.799 --> 00:07:38.620
They are showing the photos to a detective.

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:41.450
She is very interested.

00:07:41.510 --> 00:07:44.760
The detective has a plan.

00:07:44.820 --> 00:07:48.212
I know the man in the photos.

00:07:48.272 --> 00:07:50.484
He is a criminal.

00:07:50.544 --> 00:07:55.708
Now he is dead. But we can catch his murderer.

00:07:55.768 --> 00:07:59.940
The murderer will go back to the photo booth.

00:07:59.999 --> 00:08:06.154
He will want his photos. But he will find your photos, Lisa.

00:08:06.213 --> 00:08:08.525
He will look for you.

00:08:08.584 --> 00:08:14.546
You can help us, Lisa.

00:08:14.605 --> 00:08:21.058
Lisa is in the bus station.

00:08:21.118 --> 00:08:24.790
She is walking towards the photo booth.

00:08:24.850 --> 00:08:28.244
She is going to get her photos.

00:08:28.304 --> 00:08:31.576
The police are in the bus station.

00:08:31.636 --> 00:08:33.518
They are hiding.

00:08:33.578 --> 00:08:36.090
They are watching Lisa.

00:08:36.150 --> 00:08:39.804
They are waiting for the murderer.

00:08:39.864 --> 00:08:43.107
Lisa walks slowly.

00:08:43.167 --> 00:08:48.022
She is very frightened.

00:08:48.082 --> 00:08:53.656
A man is standing by the photo booth.

00:08:53.716 --> 00:08:56.678
He is young and handsome.

00:08:56.738 --> 00:08:59.918
Is this the murderer?

00:08:59.978 --> 00:09:03.000
The man sees Lisa.

00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:05.361
He smiles at her.

00:09:05.421 --> 00:09:08.252
He has a nice smile.

00:09:08.312 --> 00:09:11.844
He is holding some photos.

00:09:11.904 --> 00:09:15.215
Lisa sees his hands.

00:09:15.275 --> 00:09:18.350
She sees the snake ring.

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:22.284
She sees the bird tattoo!

00:09:22.344 --> 00:09:25.645
The police catch the murderer.

00:09:25.705 --> 00:09:28.626
The detective is pleased.

00:09:28.686 --> 00:09:32.037
Lisa is safe.

00:09:32.097 --> 00:09:35.338
Thank you for your help, Lisa.

00:09:35.398 --> 00:09:37.239
Well done, Lisa!

00:09:37.299 --> 00:09:40.030
It's exciting to catch criminals.

00:09:40.089 --> 00:09:43.050
Exciting? No!
 
00:09:43.110 --> 00:09:45.221
It's very frightening.

00:09:45.281 --> 00:09:47.994
But everything is OK now.

00:09:48.054 --> 00:09:49.931
We're going on holiday.

00:09:49.991 --> 00:09:52.657
It will be fun. Yes.
 
00:09:52.717 --> 00:10:07.454
Perhaps something exciting will happen!